{"title":"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems\">2013 AMC 12B #7</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">2013 AMC 10B #13</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Faster_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Faster Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jo and Blair take turns counting from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to one more than the last number said by the other person. Jo starts by saying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b19c547299a7e2865e9f5e86cac562ad0dd19a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$``1&quot;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" />, so Blair follows by saying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe96d07d63c88bdc11d1777a9dd6a241f9a10a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$``1, 2&quot;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Jo then says <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/4/4d4dea176b4993fa4154e7968183c2ee4b577206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$``1, 2, 3&quot;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />, and so on. What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/241bf43d042307108e47540e16589e6d05898591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53^{\\text{rd}}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> number said?<br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bb4b4403d47a7a85b5938ce917dbffae014e080.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We notice that the number of numbers said is incremented by one each time; that is, Jo says one number, then Blair says two numbers, then Jo says three numbers, etc.  Thus, after nine \"turns\", <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/0/430146f579a6c81774e8b4b6c2822ca27e955559.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+3+4+5+6+7+8+9=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"301\" height=\"14\" /> numbers have been said.  In the tenth turn, the eighth number will be the 53rd number said, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/a/9fa75655386d600f3bc2d0ee970bad628331ad74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53-45=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />.  Since we are starting from 1 every turn, the 53rd number said will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/129c1c4cbf3d35dbd549e42c49762617b1b73022.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Faster_Solution\">Faster Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Faster Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We notice that the number of numbers said is incremented by one each time; that is, Jo says one number, then Blair says two numbers, then Jo says three numbers, etc.  We notice that the number of numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/0/d00ef46bab9ecf296a4156b9c6f4bc2146fb85be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + 3 + 4 ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" /> every time we finish a \"turn\" we notice the sum of these would be the largest number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f8070867b03b0dc224db7e741135e07f4502c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" /> under 53, we can easily see that if we double this it's <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/69109cf486a851d765ce9cf112332a30939905e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 + n \\simeq 106$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />, and we immediately note that 10 is too high, but 9 is perfect, meaning that at 9, 45 numbers have been said so far, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05bbab64c4f34dc54835b7649e762bad908fcf01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9(9+1)}{2} = 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df0dcbe535538af0801a34e009ab02a0dcf7480a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53 - 45 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"139\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b8945a2aaa3228362b3976be341ad72f51f56efe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" /> denote the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th triangle number. Then, observe that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b8945a2aaa3228362b3976be341ad72f51f56efe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" />th number said is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. It follows that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />th number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7f8b19c35fd194978511bfa618a8521b6b9b021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55 = T(10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" />). Thus, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />rd number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/2326a4ec693fc25d97ef7a8a229b1c63f324a0a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - 2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~Mathavi\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's see when the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is said: the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />st number, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />nd number, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th number, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th number, and so on. We can see that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e634454c87109ec78ad737c2860ab8c1c8ac51f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\dfrac{n(n+1)}2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"40\" />th number said is always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. That means we must have the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/e/dee5eb697f3ad1aa3b859396e32e2e0bc91c1e26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\dfrac{9(9+1)}2=46$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"40\" />th number said be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The next <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> said would then be the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc39114eea4b679cec89fdee42c95eb5e49324db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+\\dfrac{10(10+1)}2=56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"161\" height=\"40\" />th number, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb47534d15cff3812b6789b062aa5d8cb8654217.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56&gt;53$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, so that means every number strictly between the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abef9fdb0235b2ede2639538b5bd76711e058fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />th and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6392be3c4d257afbc7ed9283bdb8ba630f4ef7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />th number is not <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so let's just count to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />rd number!\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/a/cfa198530ceb1ec1537f44e34aee77f90882a2a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}     46\\text{th number}&amp;\\rightarrow 1\\\\     47\\text{th number}&amp;\\rightarrow 2\\\\     48\\text{th number}&amp;\\rightarrow 3\\\\     49\\text{th number}&amp;\\rightarrow 4\\\\     50\\text{th number}&amp;\\rightarrow 5\\\\     51\\text{st number}&amp;\\rightarrow 6\\\\     52\\text{nd number}&amp;\\rightarrow 7\\\\     53\\text{rd number}&amp;\\rightarrow 8, \\end{align*}\" width=\"138\" height=\"190\" />\nso the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba318f7385187c693cb1859d9b4b1b587e649d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$53$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />rd number said is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/7/0d724db96e8cb75176d053467614c78aca041470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4e58c47fe08d4734e850135d68671cece9638e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1), (2,2), (3,4), (4,7), \\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />. Then the finite difference is 1, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbe540bd08c7b7f4b8709195614136d49a69758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a =1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/584468cd4c65823de9a250fe030f827bce3f7a6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />. Rewrite the quadratic of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cecdf9c56f989175ba8d3142814c8d77cac080fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} x^2 + bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />. Then, plugging in 1,2, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc171acd4e8f13f6e5bf586bf74bd2e1dbb5008b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + b+c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/948e9bfa816a24f9e3ccc5788dfa5faa27207d20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 2b + c = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4e242df95efabe5c478439e936830c53f301f16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/5/a65b8e9c918309bb2b33e21b490fdbb78e66b564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b+c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed30a7de2cab9f5aa482370f371854ffea32c6bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-2b = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd9e086f37da3d317acd974bef965e1c2030f92e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" />. The quadratic is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/e/c7e732b1d61889467c7219c29a9bc3505dcefae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x(x-1)}{2} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Indeed, this quadratic grants the next time \"1\" is said by either player. Hence, at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d1e7375e601943b3bb958a24e41da8920d601a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, it is said at position 22. We can use this to easily solve the problem, as in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec186fd1809357d1f530bee2334ceb59d405b4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, it is said as the 46-th position. At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/1/df19074c57a7ac2c3e780bbcb54e646493df73e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, it is said at the 56-th position, hence this \"chunk\" ranges from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e291fb78d9fd2a2b6d47a324b1dca5817ea0d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, and the 53rd number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/32101181d512779e26673b7b8e5fb3a3972cd538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10_{(55 - 2)} = \\boxed{8}_{(53)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"131\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/a-3CAo4CoWc\">https://youtu.be/a-3CAo4CoWc</a>\n</p><p>~no one\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B\">2013 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2013 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AM